            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Pennie Rabe-Fleener"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used half sugar and half sweetener because I am a diabetic and it was what I had on hand. I used cornstarch instead of flour and added nutmeg and cinnamon. It was delicious and I will make it again.",
            "datePublished": "2017-12-20T06:22:04.590Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
